yle=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            sum </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"i=\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \" sum=\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    //... 아래에 더 많은 코드들이 있다고 가정</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>while</span></span></code></span> 문의 경우 변수 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>i</span></span></code></span>의 스코프가 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>main()</span></span></code></span> 전체가 된다.</li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>for</span></span></code></span> 문의 경우 변수 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>i</span></span></code></span>의 스코프가 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>for</span></span></code></span> 문 안으로 한정된다.</li>\n<li>따라서 변수 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>i</span></span></code></span>처럼 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>for</span></span></code></span> 문 <strong>안에서만 사용되는 변수가 있다면</strong> <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>while</span></span></code></span> 문 보다는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>for</span></span></code></span> 문을 사용하여 <mark>스코프의 범위를 제한하는 것이 메모리 사용과 유지보수 측면에서 더 좋다.</mark></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"형변환\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#형변환\">형변환</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"자동-형변환\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#자동-형변환\">자동 형변환</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>작은 범위 → 큰 범위로는 값을 넣을 수 있다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> → <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>long</span></span></code></span> → <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>double</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>큰 범위에서 작은 범위는 문제가 발생할 수 있다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>오버플로우</li>\n<li>소수점 버림</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>작은 범위 → 큰 범위로 대입은 허용한다.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>자바의 숫자 표현 범위</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> &#x3C; <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>long</span></span></code></span> &#x3C; <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>double</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>자바는 기본적으로 같은 타입에 값을 대입 가능</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>다른 타입에 값을 대입하면...</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> → <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>long</span></span></code></span>\n<ul>\n<li>long이 int보다 더 큰 숫자 범위를 표현</li>\n<li>작은 범위 숫자 타입에서 큰 범위 숫자 타입에 대입하는 경우이므로, 문제가 되지 않음</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>long</span></span></code></span> → <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>double</span></span></code></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>double</span></span></code></span>이 부동소수점을 사용하기 때문에 더 큰 숫자 범위를 표현함, 문제가 되지 않음</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><mark><strong>자바에서 작은 범위 타입에서 큰 범위 타입으로의 대입은 허용된다.</strong></mark></li>\n<li>하지만 결국 대입하는 타입을 맞추어야 하기 때문에 개념적으로는 아래와 같이 동작한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// intValue = 10;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">doubleValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intValue;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">doubleValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">double</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) intValue; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 타입 맞추기</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">doubleValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">double</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 변수 값 읽기</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">doubleValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10.0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 타입 변환</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>위 처럼 값 앞에 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>(double)</span></span></code></span> 과 같이 타입을 적어주면 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> 타입이 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>double</span></span></code></span> 타입으로 변한다. 이를 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>형변환</span></span></code></span>이라고 한다.</li>\n<li>작은 범위 숫자 타입에서 큰 범위 숫자 타입으로의 형변환은 개발자가 직접 하지 않아도 된다.</li>\n<li>자동으로 일어나기 때문에 <strong>자동 형변환</strong>, 또는 <strong>묵시적 형변환</strong> 이라고 한다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"명시적-형변환\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#명시적-형변환\">명시적 형변환</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>반대로 큰 범위 → 작은 범위로 대입에는 <strong>명시적 형변환</strong>이 필요하다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>double</span></span></code></span> 은 실수를 표현할 수 있다. 따라서 1.5를 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>double</span></span></code></span> 타입으로 표현하는 것은 가능하다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>그러나 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> 는 실수를 표현할 수 없다. 따라서 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> 타입에 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>double</span></span></code></span> 타입을 대입하게 되면 1.5에서 .5를 표현할 수 없게 된다.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Casting2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        double</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> doubleValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.5</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // intValue = doubleValue; // 컴파일 에러</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) doubleValue; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 명시적 형변환</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"intValue = \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intValue); </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// intValue = 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>그러나 이런 위험을 알고도 값을 대입하고 싶다면, 데이터 타입을 강제로 변환할 수 있다. 이것을 <strong>형변환(Casting)</strong>이라고 한다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>그리고 개발자가 직접 형변환 코드를 입력한다고 해서 <strong>명시적 형변환</strong>이라고 한다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>개념적인 동작 과정은 아래와 같다.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// doubleValue = 1.5;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) doubleValue;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// doubleValue에 있는 값을 읽는다.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (int)로 형변환 한다. intValue에 int 타입인 숫자 1을 대입한다.</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>형변환을 한다고 해서 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>doubleValue</span></span></code></span>의 타입이 변경되거나, 그 안에 있는 값이 변경되는 것은 아니다. <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>doubleValue</span></span></code></span>에서 읽은 값을 형변환 하는 것이다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>doubleValue</span></span></code></span> 안에 들어있는 값은 1.5 그대로 유지된다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>변수 값은 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>대입연산자(=)</span></span></code></span>를 사용하여 직접 대입할 때만 변경된다.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"형변환과-오버플로우\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#형변환과-오버플로우\">형변환과 오버플로우</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Casting3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        long</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxIntValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2147483647</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// int 최고값</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        long</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxIntOver </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2147483648L</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// int 최고값 + 1 (초과)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) maxIntValue; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 형변환</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"maxIntValue Casting = \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intValue);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // maxIntValue Casting = 2147483647</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) maxIntOver; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 형변환</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"maxIntOver Casting = \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intValue);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // maxIntOver Casting = -2147483648: 오버플로우 발생</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>정상 범위</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>long maxIntValue = 2147483647;</span></span></code></span>는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span>의 가장 큰 숫자를 입력했다.</li>\n<li>이 경우 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> 로 표현할 수 있는 범위에 포함되기에 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>long</span></span></code></span> → <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> 형변환이 문제가 없다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>초과 범위</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>long maxIntOver = 2147483648L;</span></span></code></span>는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span>의 가장 큰 숫자(2147483647)보다 1 큰 숫자를 입력했다.</li>\n<li>이 경우 리터럴은 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> 범위를 넘어가기 때문에 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>L</span></span></code></span>을 붙여 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>long</span></span></code></span> 타입을 사용해야 한다.</li>\n<li>또한 위처럼 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>long</span></span></code></span> → <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span> 형변환에서 문제가 생긴다.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">maxIntOver </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2147483648L</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// int 최고값 + 1 (초과)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) maxIntOver; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 변수 값 읽기</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2147483648L</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 형변환 시도</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intValue </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2147483648</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// int의 가장 작은 숫자(오버플로우)</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>결과는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>-2147483648</span></span></code></span> 이라는 값이 나온다.\n<ul>\n<li>-2147483648는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>int</span></span></code></span>가 표현할 수 있는 가장 작은 숫자이다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>이렇게 기존 범위를 초과하여 표현하게 되면 전혀 다른 숫자가 표현되는 현상을 <strong>오버플로우</strong> 라고 한다.\n<ul>\n<li>오버플로우가 발생하면 시계가 한 바퀴 돈 듯이 처음부터 시작한다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>오버플로우가 발생하는 것 자체가 문제이며 우리는 오버플로우가 발생하지 않도록 막아야 한다.</li>\n<li>이런 경우 int → long 으로 변경하여 사이즈를 늘리면 문제가 해결된다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","headings",[69,70,71,72,73,74,75],"related",[66],"localGraph",{"_49":50,"_51":52},"index",[23,24,25,26,27,28,29,30],{"_31":47,"_33":48},{"_31":45,"_33":46},{"_31":43,"_33":44},{"_31":41,"_33":42},{"_31":39,"_33":40},{"_31":37,"_33":38},{"_31":35,"_33":36},{"_31":32,"_33":34},"slug","serialization-deserialization","title","직렬화(Serialization)/역직렬화(Deserialization)","WWDC25-Whats-new-in-widgets","[WWDC25] What's new in widgets","java-first-step","김영한의 자바 입문 - 코드로 시작하는 자바 첫걸음","java-first-step-variable","김영한의 자바 입문 - 변수","java-first-step-operator","김영한의 자바 입문 - 연산자","java-first-step-conditionals","김영한의 자바 입문 - 조건문","java-first-step-loop-statement","김영한의 자바 입문 - 반복문","java-first-step-scope-casting","김영한의 자바 입문 - 스코프, 형변환","nodes",[56,57],"links",[53],{"_54":47,"_55":37},"source","target",{"_58":47,"_59":48,"_60":64,"_62":65},{"_58":37,"_59":38,"_60":61,"_62":63},"id","name","category","java","val",6,"jav",2,{"_31":37,"_33":38,"_67":68},"date","2026-11-03",{"_58":90,"_77":90,"_79":65},{"_58":88,"_77":89,"_79":80},{"_58":86,"_77":87,"_79":80},{"_58":85,"_77":85,"_79":65},{"_58":83,"_77":84,"_79":80},{"_58":81,"_77":82,"_79":80},{"_58":76,"_77":78,"_79":80},"형변환과-오버플로우","text","형변환과 오버플로우","level",3,"명시적-형변환","명시적 형변환","자동-형변환","자동 형변환","형변환","for-vs-whlie-스코프를-통해-생각해보기","for vs whlie 스코프를 통해 생각해보기","스코프의-존재-이유","스코프의 존재 이유","스코프","2026-11-10","description","","readingTime",5]
